Accident victim identified by the police
A 63-year-old pedestrian, dying in the hospital after being hit by a vehicle, has been identified.
Carole Paulson, from Chelmsford Road to Brentwood, was involved in the accident on Friday afternoon on Shenfield Road.
It was transported to Queen's Hospital, Romford, but then died.
